<title>AUSTRALIA: RTS-Moody's may upgrade W.Australia and Victoria.</title>
<headline>RTS-Moody's may upgrade W.Australia and Victoria.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moody's Investor's Service said it has placed the ratings of the Australian states of Victoria and Western Australia on review for possible upgrade.</p>
</text>
